) baseline health before restart","command_ids":["cmd-c739ec0f94f04d92"],"summary":"Captured boot_id 416c5cf5..., uptime since 22:57:39, and confirmed ansible-core present prior to restart."},{"requirement":"node2 restart acknowledgement and changed boot identity","command_ids":["cmd-08d2b782d4d74437","cmd-7f9be6d0215e471b","cmd-3f78a1e0612544f9","cmd-7472d1c70b2b4f56"],"summary":"systemctl reboot launched in background with ack returned before disconnect; subsequent polls show connection timeout then reset then success, confirming the node cycled down and back up."},{"requirement":"node2 post-restart boot identity change and recovered functional state","command_ids":["cmd-f5bd01428b3e440b"],"summary":"New boot_id f1190db0... (changed from 416c5cf5...); re-verified ansible install, live SSH to node1, and a fresh ansible-playbook run against node1 returned changed=0, proving both the control node's tooling and node1's target state (appworker account/limits) survived both restarts intact."}]},"ttft_ms":3576,"type":"result","duration_ms":158295,"uuid":"85e85aa2-9e1e-419a-bbe4-d0754bacaabf","ttft_stream_ms":2067,"time_to_request_ms":185,"first_content_frame_ms":2068,"queued_turn_count":0,"result_index":0}
